              <div class="svc-pane-left">
                <h3>Brand Identity & Strategy</h3>
                <p>We craft compelling brand identities, from logo design to typography and color palettes, ensuring your business stands out in a crowded market.</p>
                <ul class="svc-client-list">
                  <li><a href="/services#brand">Brand Guidelines</a></li>
                  <li><a href="/services#brand">Visual Identity</a></li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div class="svc-pane-right">
                <div class="svc-img img-1"><img src="https://picsum.photos/400/500?random=41" loading="lazy" width="400" height="500" decoding="async" /></div>
